{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2019-10-16 22:30:00', 'title': 'Ball Corporation to Build New Aluminum Cups Manufacturing Plant in Georgia', 'text': "Ball Corporation announced that it will begin construction on its first dedicated aluminum cups manufacturing facility to serve the growing demand for innovative, sustainable beverage packaging for U.S. customers and consumers. The new aluminum cups manufacturing facility will be adjacent to Ball's existing aluminum beverage can manufacturing plant in Rome, Georgia, and is expected to ramp up production in the fourth quarter of 2020. Ball plans to hire approximately 145 new employees for the cups facility to support the multi-year investment of approximately $200 million."}
{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2019-10-16 09:30:00', 'title': 'Bank Of America Reports Quarterly Earnings Of $5.8 Billion, EPS $0.56', 'text': 'BANK OF AMERICA REPORTS QUARTERLY EARNINGS OF $5.8 BILLION, EPS $0.56.BANK OF AMERICA - QTRLY RESULTS INCLUDE MERCHANT SERVICES JOINT VENTURE IMPAIRMENT CHARGE OF $2.1 BILLION (PRETAX), OR $0.19 PER DILUTED SHARE.BANK OF AMERICA - QTRLY PROVISION FOR CREDIT LOSSES OF $779 MILLION.QTRLY REVENUE, NET OF INTEREST EXPENSE, INCREASED MODESTLY TO $22.8 BILLION.QTRLY FICC REVENUE OF $2.1 BILLION REMAINED FLAT.QTRLY AVERAGE LOAN AND LEASE BALANCES IN BUSINESS SEGMENTS ROSE $52 BILLION, OR 6%, TO $923 BILLION.QTRLY EQUITIES REVENUE OF $1.1 BILLION INCREASED 13% DRIVEN BY GROWTH IN CLIENT FINANCING ACTIVITIES.QTRLY NONINTEREST EXPENSE OF $15.2 BILLION COMPARED TO $13.0 BILLION.QTRLY NET INTEREST INCOME $12,187 MILLION VERSUS $12,061 MILLION.QTRLY NET CHARGE-OFF RATIO OF 0.34% VERSUS 0.38% AT Q2-END.QTRLY NONINTEREST INCOME $10,620 MILLION VERSUS $10,663 MILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.51, REVENUE VIEW $22.79 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE EXCLUDING JV IMPAIRMENT CHARGE $0.75.'}
