{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2019-10-16 22:30:00', 'title': 'Pensando Systems announced that it has received $145 million in funding from Hewlett Packard Enterprise Company, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Equinix, Inc. (REIT), and other investors.', 'text': 'Pensando Systems announced that it has received $145 million in a round of funding co-led by new investors, Hewlett Packard Enterprise Company (NYSE:HPE) and Lightspeed Venture Partners on October 16, 2019. The transaction also included participation from new investor, Equinix, Inc. (REIT) (NasdaqGS:EQIX) and and others. The company has raised $278 million in funding till date. As a part of the transaction, Mark Potter, Chief Technology Officer of Hewlett Packard Enterprise and Barry Eggers, a partner of Lightspeed Venture Partners joined the board of directors of the company.'}
